let __v_893 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$dict\":[[\"care home\",\"No experience needed, and care homes are always short: apply on the home's own website or walk in and ask for the manager. They pay for your DBS check, and you do the Care Certificate in the first twelve weeks.\"],[\"supermarket\",\"Apply on the store's own careers page, no CV needed, and tick evenings and weekends as well. Till and shelf work needs no experience, and the interview is mostly 'tell me about a time you helped someone', so have one ready.\"],[\"school\",\"Ring the school office and ask to go on their supply or cover list for teaching assistant, midday supervisor and admin work, because the office hires all year. All of them need a DBS check, which takes a few weeks, so start now.\"],[\"cafe\",\"Walk in between two and four, when it is quiet, with a one-page CV, and ask for the manager by name. Cafe and bar work needs no certificate, though a free Level 2 food hygiene course online helps, and the shifts go to whoever can start this week.\"],[\"warehouse\",\"Sign up with two or three local agencies, then take one shift to get a foot in. Warehouses take packers and pickers with no experience, and the agency does the paperwork.\"],[\"nursery\",\"Ask the nurseries near you about assistant jobs. You need a DBS check, but not a qualification to start: they take unqualified staff and put you through the Level 2 childcare course in the job.\"],[\"hospital\",\"Search the NHS jobs site for the trust's own vacancies rather than a job board: porters, cleaners, admin staff and healthcare assistants mostly need no experience. The DBS and the health checks come after they offer you the job.\"],[\"hotel\",\"Ask at reception for the housekeeping or kitchen manager and apply direct. Hotels take on room attendants and kitchen porters with no experience, and the hours often fit round a school run.\"],[\"charity shop\",\"Volunteer in one first. The manager will take you for a few hours a week on no more than a form, and that counter experience is what a paid retail job wants to see.\"],[\"council\",\"Apply on the council's own jobs page rather than a job board, because they use an application form, not a CV. It is scored against the person specification, so answer each line of that with one example and use its own words.\"]]}")?;
